NOTICE

This plugin contains UI components and logic patterns ported from
ai-usagebar by Fabio Akita (https://github.com/akitaonrails/ai-usagebar),
licensed under the MIT License:

  UsageBar.qml, UsageRow.qml and parts of Logic.js are derived from the
  kde-plasmoid frontend (UsageBar.qml, UsageRow.qml, plasmoid-logic.mjs)
  of ai-usagebar.

The z.ai usage endpoint (api.z.ai/api/monitor/usage/quota/limit) is
undocumented and was reverse-engineered by third parties; treat it as
fragile.
